{# Why the dashboard offers to archive a channel. #}
{% macro archiveReason(channel) -%}
    {%- if channel.inactive -%}
        Nobody has posted in this channel in the last 30 days.
    {%- else -%}
        This channel has fewer than 2 members.
    {%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro %}

{# What archiving does. #}
{% macro archiveEffects() -%}
    Archiving removes it from people's channel list and stops new messages. Its history stays searchable, and it can be unarchived in Slack.
{%- endmacro %}
